1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Car won't start?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The way it fails is one clue.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Lights dim, nothing else happens?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That may indicate the battery.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
One fast click, nothing turns over?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
That can point to the starter.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Starts fine, then a battery light while driving?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Worth checking the alternator.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess — three parts, three different bills.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — we test all three free. Link in bio.
